      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Pants Fit Guide | Slim, Regular, Relaxed and Custom Fits</h2>
    </div>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;">
      Slim fit pants are tapered from hip to ankle, creating a close-to-body silhouette that follows the natural leg line without being restrictive. This fit is popular for smart casual and modern dress pants, offering a contemporary look that works well with both casual and semi-formal attire. Slim fit typically features a narrower leg opening of 14-16 inches at the hem for a streamlined appearance.
    </p>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      Regular fit pants feature a straight leg with comfortable room through the seat and thigh. This classic fit is the most versatile option, suitable for everyday wear across various body types. Regular fit provides a balanced silhouette that isn't too tight or too loose, making it ideal for office wear, casual settings, and everything in between. The leg opening typically measures 16-18 inches for a traditional straight cut.
    </p>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      Relaxed fit pants offer generous room through the hip and thigh with a straight or tapered leg. This fit prioritizes comfort over form-fitting appearance, making it perfect for casual wear, workwear, and individuals who prefer a looser silhouette. Relaxed fit accommodates athletic builds and allows for unrestricted movement. The leg opening ranges from 18-20 inches depending on the specific design.
    </p>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      Athletic fit combines generous room through the thigh with a tapered knee and ankle. This fit is designed for active lifestyles, providing comfort where it's needed while maintaining a modern silhouette. Athletic fit works well for joggers, performance trousers, and casual pants intended for movement. Our <a href="/fit-engineering-service" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:underline;">fit engineering service</a> develops custom fit blocks tailored to your target demographic.
    </p>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      SDF handles custom fit grading for US, UK, EU, and AU markets. Our <a href="/grading-service" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:underline;">grading service</a> ensures consistent fit across all size ranges, from XS to 5XL. We create grade rules that maintain the intended silhouette proportions across sizes, ensuring your customers receive consistent fit regardless of their size. Custom grading accommodates specific market preferences and body type variations.
