      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What fabrics do you use for pants?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We use cotton twill, cotton canvas, wool blends, polyester blends, linen, denim, stretch fabrics with elastane, and performance fabrics. Fabric selection depends on pant type and intended use.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Can you customize pants with different fits and details?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We offer custom fits (slim, regular, relaxed, plus), waistband styles, pocket configurations, hem finishes, and closure types. Custom details like pleats, cuffs, and decorative stitching available.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does pants production take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Standard production timeline: 35-45 days from fabric receipt for basic pants. 40-55 days for custom fabric development or specialized fabrics. 7-14 days for sampling before bulk.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you offer stretch fabrics for pants?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We offer stretch fabrics with elastane/spandex for comfort and mobility. Popular for chinos, joggers, and casual trousers. Stretch content typically 2-5% for dress pants, 5-10% for casual wear.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What size ranges do you offer for pants?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We offer full size ranges from 28-inch waist to 42-inch waist with regular, short, and tall inseam options. Custom sizing available for specific brand requirements. Size run flexibility within MOQ enables balanced inventory distribution.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Can you manufacture custom waistbands and closures?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We offer various waistband styles including standard waistband, elastic waistband, drawstring waistband, and high-rise options. Closure options include button fly, zipper fly, snap buttons, and hook-and-bar. Custom belt loops and waistband lining available.</p>
